Change Log file for dsh

$Id$

Changes in 1.20:

o Make remote_argv dynamic, this allows multiple -o arguments to be
  used on the command line.
o Cleaned up code to compile cleanly with fascist warning turned on
  -Wall -pedantic -Wshadow -Wpointer-arith -Wcast-align -Wmissing-prototypes
  -Wmissing-declarations -Wnested-externs -Winline -W.
o One last reversal of rcmd_pgm and dsh_remote command fixed.
o Added man page for dsh.
o Added support to Makefile.am to propagate configure variables
  into the man pages.
o Added ChangeLog file
o Updated README
o Added INSTALL
